{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00000","headline":"春宫怨 · 杜荀鹤","name":"春宫怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早被婵娟误，欲妆临镜慵。\n承恩不在貌，教妾若爲容。\n风暖鸟声碎，日高花影重。\n年年越溪女，相忆采芙蓉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"萧涤非"}